<title>GERMANY: No German intvn grain export bids received-BLE.</title>
<headline>No German intvn grain export bids received-BLE.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>German state grain intervention board BLE said it had not received any bids for the export of intervention grain to third countries at Thursday's weekly EU grain export tender.</p>
<p>This was the second consecutive week where the German trade showed no interest in intervention exports.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
